<nigel_wireker. specstult. 254>	" En per earn teneor tanquam captiva, quid ergo ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 255>	" Non honor est, sed onus, hsec mea cauda mihi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 256>	" Esto quod hinc possem cauda remanente redire,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 257>	" Semper erunt oneri cauda lutumque mihi *
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 258>	" Attrahit ipsa lutum pendens oneratque ferentem
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 259>	" Quid tribuat video nil, nisi triste, mihi?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 260>	" Libera nunc essem, nuUoque tenente redirem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 261>	" Ni foret in causa sordida cauda mihi.^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 262>	" Tollere materiam, ne propter materiatum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 263>	" Hie ego deficiam,^ tutius esse puto.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 264>	" Causidici dicunt, quia legibus est ita cautum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 265>	" Causatum perimit causa perempta suum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 266>	*' Sanius est partem quam totam,'' perdere caudam
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 267>	" Quam caput hoc modicum, quam meliora minus.^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 268>	" Malo mihi caudara pariter cum crure ^ revelli,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 269>	" Quam subito vitam claudere^ morte meam.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 270>	" Forsitan hie alias siniili ratione morarer,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 271>	" Quoque ^ modo teneor nunc ^ retinerer item.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 272>	" Si mea cauda modo fuerit succisa, regressus
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 273>	" Tutior hie aderit quam fuit ante mihi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 274>	" Parvula, si peream, meeum mea nata peribit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 275>	" Quam nondum quintum constat habere diem.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 276>	" Et si non pro me faciam mihi talia, saltem
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 277>	" Propter eam fieri cogit, oportet ita.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 278>	" Cor^Doris hsec nostri pars est, quam dente procaci
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 279>	" Consuevere canes dilacerare prius.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 280>	" Dimidiumque fere jam pridem surripuere ; •"
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 281>	" Heu mihi ! quod ^ reliquum restitit usque modo ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 282>	" Quod superest canibus placet hoc impendere natfe,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 283>	" Hocque pium satis est, hocque salubre mihi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 284>	" Ergo quid ulterius, quse sum factura, morabor,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 285>	" Casibus in duris accelerare juvat."
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 286>	Dixit, et arreptam caudam pugione recidit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 287>	Festinansque domum cavpere coepit iter.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 288>	Ante tamen studuit ferrum prsestare sorori,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 289>	Posset ut a simili solvere vincla sibi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 290>	Sed minus hsec prseceps, prudensque magis, patienter**
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 291>	Verba tulit, cohibens a pugione manum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 292>	Responsio Brunettce.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 293>	Postea respondens dixit,'' " Quid, inepta, laboras?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 294>	" Quod mihi persuades ? Absit ut illud agam !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 295>	" Rebus in adversis opus est moderamine multo,^"
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 296>	" Non decet in gravibus prsecipitare gradum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 297>	" Rebus in ambiguis quotiens fovtuna laborat,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 298>	" Consilium prceceps non decet esse nimis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 299>	" Impetus, ut memini, gravis est, male certa ^ minis" trat;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 300>	" Si male cuncta facit, ergo nee ulla bene.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 301>	" Non opus est gravibus, ubi res gravis est et acerba,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 302>	" Sed raagis auxilio consilioque bono.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 303>	" Mitius in duris sapiens Cato mandat agendum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 304>	" MoUia ne pereant asperitate gravi,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 305>	" Res ubi difficilis, non est ita prsecipitandum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 306>	" Tempore sanatur quod ratione nequit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 307>	" Si fortuna modo gravis est, conversa repente
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 308>	" Quod grave portamus alleviabit onus.^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 309>	" Tempora labuntur, dominique cadunt,'^ renovantur
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 310>	" Servi, vulgus abit, area lata patet."*
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 311>	" Quae veniunt subito, subito quandoque reeedunt
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 312>	" Prospera cum duris mixta venire solent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 313>	" Fortuitos casus non est vitare volentum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 314>	" Nemo futurorum prsescius esse potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 315>	" Plus valet interdum non pi-£etimuisse futura,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 316>	" Quam certum fieri sollicitumque nimis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 317>	" Nam sua multotiens docuit vexatio multos,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 318>	" Obfuit et multis ^ prosperitate frui.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 319>	" Casibus in Isetis minor est soUertia multis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 320>	" Erudit incautos sollicitudo gravis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 321>	" Casibus in Isetis magis est metuenda voluptas,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 322>	" Segnius in vitium tristia corda ruunt.^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 323>	" Integra Troja fuit dum se suspectus utrimque ^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 324>	" Subtraxit ^ durus liostis ab hoste suo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 325>	" Pax data subvertit, quae prselia non potuerunt,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 326>	" Moenia, plus nocuit rege remissa manus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 327>	" Sola venire solent et vix et raro ^ secunda
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 328>	" Turbine vallata sors inimica venit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 329>	" Si fortuna dedit dudum mihi dulcia, quare
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 330>	" Dedigner sub ea paucula dura pati ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 331>	" Dura quideni patior, sed non duranda per annum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 332>	" Nondum prceteriit tota vel una dies.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 333>	" Principis aut regis si careere tenta ligarer,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 334>	" Asperiora luto ferrea vincla forent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 335>	" Mollius esse lutum ferro quis nesciat? ipsos
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 336>	" Reges et satrapas ferrea vincla tenent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 337>	" Si leviora luti quam regia vincula ferri,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 338>	" Est levior certe sors mea sorte sua.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 339>	" Illos forte sua quinquennia vincula servant,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 340>	" Forsitan in triduo careere solvar ego.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 341>	" Flante levi Zephyro, Notus in sua regna redibit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 342>	" Percipientque '^ statum prata lutosa suum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 343>	" Tunc dissolventur raea per se^ vincula gratis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 344>	" Et remanebit adhuc hsec mea cauda mihi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 345>	" Me cito privasse possem, sed poenituisse
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 346>	" Forsitan seternum perpetuumque foret.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 347>	" Sorte pari poterit nox una resolvere ^ vinctam,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 348>	" Sicut et anterius una ligavit earn.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 349>	" Non decet ut quotiens qusedam minus apta putantur,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 350>	" Quod quis perpetua jure relegit ^ ea.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 351>	" Sed quibus'' obstat hiems a3statis gratia prosit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 352>	" Ut sua quem dejicit sors aliena levet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 353>	" Sicque vices varias pev se sua tempera mittunt,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 354>	" Posset^ ut alterius alter honore frui.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 355>	" Dulce relativum socialia foedera jungit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 356>	" Fortius incedunt foedera juncta mihi.^"
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 357>	"' Quod minus alter habet, sua quern fortuna gravavit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 358>	" Suppleat alterius copia grata magis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 359>	" Nil ita pr^ecipuum vel tain sublime creatum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 360>	" Ut non alterius possit ^ egere manu.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 361>	" Tempora sive vices vario discrimine certant,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 362>	" Nee coeunt nexu fcedera quseque pari.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 363>	" Ssepe breves frutices currentia ^ sternere plaustra
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 364>	" Vidimus, et celeres detinuisse boves.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 365>	" Ssepe brevis magnas subvertit machina turres,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 366>	" Tmpulsuque levi moenia summa ruuut.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 367>	" Se premit imbre brevi violentia maxima venti,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 368>	" Atque procellosas mitigat Eurus aquas.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 369>	" Nil contemnendum reputes, quod tempore quovis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 370>	" Ferre vel auxilium vel nocuisse potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 371>	" Vilius interdum quod carius esse putamus
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 372>	" Constat, et est majus quod minus esse putas.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 373>	" Obstitit interdum magnis res parva periclis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 374>	" Terruit et rapidos parvula virga canes.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 375>	" Urbibus in mediis incendia magna repente
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 376>	" Extingui modica saepe videmus aqua.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 377>	Commendatio caudce.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 378>	" Corporis ergo mei quamvis pars ultima cauda,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 379>	" Utilius tamen hac nil reor esse mihi.^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 380>	" Quse quamvis oneri modo sit nuUoque^ decori,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 381>	" ^stivo redimit tempore damna sui.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 382>	" Unica cauda milii plus quam duo cornua prsestant
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 383>	" Tempore muscarum, plusque salutis habet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 384>	" Ventilat lisec vespes/ ssevos dispergit oestres,"
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 385>	" Yerberat et muscas improbitate graves.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 386>	" Cauda mihi clypeus, gladius mihi cauda, securis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 387>	" Lancea, funda, lapis, clava, sagitta, faces.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 388>	" Cauda colit corpus, cutis est fidissima nutrix,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 389>	" Pulveris abstergens quicquid adha^sit eis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 390>	" Usee lavat, liaec tergit, heec omnibus una niinistrat,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 391>	" Ultima memborrum, prima labore suo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 392>	" Si bene pensetur, quid honoris et utilitatis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 393>	" Contulerint dominse singula membra suse,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 394>	" Sola suo capiti membris sed et omnibus una
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 395>	" Plus valet, est et eis officiosa magis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 396>	" Omnibus una cavens fragilis discrimina sexus,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 397>	" Publica ne pateant cauda pudenda tegit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 398>	" Hsec mea cauda mihi vario pro tempore confert,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 399>	" Quse tamen est certo tempore grata m_agis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 400>	" Tempora nam timeo qua? sunt mihi jure timenda,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 401>	" Nee timet incassum qui mala nota^ timet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 402>	" Cumque quid et passa sim vel passura recorder,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 403>	" H?ec ego sum semper dicere visa mihi
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 404>	" Ecce dies venimit veris, muscseque resurgent,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 405>	" Quas castigat ^ adhuc cana pruina gelu,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 406>	" Cum calor ajstatis nimio fervore ^ per agros
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 407>	" Sparserit omne pecus terrueritque greges;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 408>	" Musca, gravis pestis, qua nulla nocivior ^ unquani
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 409>	" Extitit in mundo vel magis atra ]ues.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 410>	" Dente gravi miseras totum sparsura per orbem
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 411>	" Percutiet pecudes, nee sinet*^ ire pedes.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 412>	" Namque levi saltu tanquam per inane volantes
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 413>	" Morsibus et stimulis exagitabit eas.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 414>	" Illa'^ dies caudam cunctis dabit^ esse salubrem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 415>	" Et suus sestatem prsevenit augur hiems.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 416>	" Forte dies aderit in qua, ni fallor,^ egebit
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 417>	" Vacca sua cauda quam modo sprevit ^° ita.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 418>	" Ilia dies caudse faciet meminisse juvencas,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 419>	" Et steriles vaccas, emeritosque ^^ boves.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 420>	" Ilia dies caudjB faciet meminisse Bicornis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 421>	" Qua mallet ^ cauda non habuisse caput.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 422>	" Ilia dies caudas mundo faciet prseciosas,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 423>	" Qua) plus sunt viles quam vetus olla modo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 424>	" Ilia dies dura, multumque timenda^ per orbem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 425>	" Tanquam Judicii plena timoris erit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 426>	" Ilia dies caudas nostras numerabit, et ilia
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 427>	" Discernet pariter quce bona quseve mala.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 428>	" Ilia dies caudas nostras discernet utrasque,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 429>	" Quae bene mundata, quoeve lutosa nimis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 430>	" Hsec est ilia dies in qua, si forte juvenca
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 431>	" Posset habere duas, vellet^ habere decern.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 432>	" Haec est ilia dies veniet qua durus oester,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 433>	" Tortor vaccarum maximus atque boum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 434>	" Heec est ilia dies qu?e muscas dente caninas
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 435>	" Morsibus et stimulis mittet* in omne pecus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 436>	" Ht"ec est ilia dies quam prsetimuisse futuram
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 437>	" Expedit armento,^ ne patiatur in hac.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 438>	" O mihi quam felix ! misera," quiB posset ab ilia
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 439>	" Evasisse die, quam timet omne pecus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 440>	" Hanc etiam plus morte mea formido futuranj,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 441>	" Qua nisi tunc munda non" ero tuta satis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 442>	" Namque graves muscse niraium, fervoi-que diei^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 443>	" Multus erit, nee ibi quis latuisse potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 444>	" Nee pecori tantum fervor musc^eque nocebunt,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 445>	" Sed dominis pecorum pastoribusque gregum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 446>	" Hsec est ilia dies qua non aliena juvabit
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 447>	" Cauda, nee alterius quid nocuisse potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 448>	" Sed nee ^ pastor ibi pecori,^*^ taurusve juvencre,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 449>	" Parve pari poterit^V ferre salutis opem.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 450>	" Hsec est ilia dies qua nil nisi ^ cauda^ juvabit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 451>	" Vel loca quae musea tangere nidla potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 452>	" Hsec est ilia dies de qua si^ vera fatemur,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 453>	" Pendet ab illius nostra salute salus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 454>	" Ergo licet tenear cauda, graviterque coarcter,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 455>	" Non tamen efFrangar* ipsa dolore meo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 456>	" Malo per hos^ septem vel quinque dies cruciari,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 457>	" Forsitan interea tristis abibit liiems
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 458>	" Quam prselonga'' nimis me fervida torreat sestas,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 459>	" Dilaceretque meam musca canina cutem.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 460>	Qualiter Brunetta liherata est.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 461>	" Talia dum memorat, modico recreata sopore,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 462>	" Flante levi^ Zepliyro tempora versa videt.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 463>	" Sol calet, et superas clarus devexus^ in auras,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 464>	" Diflfusis radiis temperat omne gelu.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 465>	" Solvitur uuda fluens, humus exhilarata tepeseit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 466>	" Aufugit et subito cana pruina solo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 467>	" Et status et facies silvis redduntur et arvis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 468>	" Cuncta relaxantur carcere clausa prius.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 469>	" Nee mora, consurgens eaudam Brunetta retraxit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 470>	" Acceleransque domum carpere coepit iter.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 471>	" Quam procul ut videt® sanam remeare Bicornis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 472>	" Ingemit, et ^^ tonso ^^ pectore tristis ait.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 473>	Lamentatio Bicornis}^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 474>	" Heu mihi ! quid feci ? quis me furor egit iniquus ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 475>	" Quam nimis accelerans iu mea damna fui ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 476>	O quam perduros habet impatientia fines
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 477>	" Quamque solet prseceps exitus esse gravis !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 478>	Vee mihi ! vse miserae ! vse nunquam non miserandse !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 479>	" Vse, cui nil nisi vse tempus in omne manet
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 480>	Vse mihi ! quod ego nunc ^ cunctis ^ animantibus " una
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 481>	" Sum data ludibrio ^ tempus in omne meum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 482>	Cur mihi cum cauda non est mea vita recisa,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 483>	" Ut caput et Cauda continuata forent?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 484>	Cur non terra prius ? cur non absorbuit unda
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 485>	" Fluminis ? ^ aut missis ignibus usta fui ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 486>	Quseque nimis prseceps, non mea fata ^ secuta
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 487>	" Montibus e summis praecipitata rui ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 488>	Heu mihi ! cur laquei circum mea guttura missi
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 489>	" Vitam cum vitio non rapuere meo ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 490>	Car non mors subita vitam, vel sonticus ille ^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 491>	" Morbus ademisset,'' qui vagus esse solet ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 492>	Quid queror? una mihi superest medicina doloris,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 493>	" Mors cita, quae sola solvere cuncta solet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 494>	Nee mora quin solvat, jam formidabilis sestas
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 495>	" Imminet, exit hiems, vere vigente novo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 496>	Vivet ^ in exemplum populis moritura Bicornis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 497>	" Instruct et stultos^ simplicitate sua.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 498>	Di scant prsecipites et quos mora nulla retardat,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 499>	" Ne nimis accelerent in sua damna manus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 500>	Non reputet modicum modico contenta voluptas,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 501>	" Res de postfacto^*' quod fuit ante docet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 502>	Nee modicum quicquam reputet, si tempore quovis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 503>	" Fortuito casu perdere possit ^^ idem.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 504>	Cauda nocet capiti proprio, prohibetque timeri
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 505>	" Cornua, dum nietuunt posteriora sequi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 506>	" Quid queror incassum ? Mando tamen ista modernis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 507>	" Qui post me venient, lisec duo verba legant
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 508>	" Dura superest nihil est, nihiloque minus quod liabemus
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 509>	" Cedat, et est magnum quod fuit ante nihil.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 510>	" Nil mea cauda fuit, mihi dum ^ conjuncta maneret,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 511>	" Maxima sed postquam desiit esse fuit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 512>	" Perdere cum timeas magnum, reputare memento
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 513>	" Quicquid habes, modicum sit licet illud idem.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 514>	" Desierat tandem, mentis stimulata Bicornis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 515>	" Anxietate gravi, talia verba loqui.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 516>	Quid aeciderlt Bicorni.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 517>	" Venerat interea tempus quo fertilis sestas
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 518>	" Prata solet primo pingere flore novo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 519>	" Induerat jam fronde nemus, jam gramine terram
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 520>	" Texerat, intextis floribus arte pari.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 521>	" Exierant volucres hiemis de carcere fracto,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 522>	" Solvere finitimis digna tributa locis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 523>	" Verba negata sibi redimens philomena sonoris ^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 524>	" Vocibus insistit, personat omne nemus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 525>	" Quos natura vocat, cum turture venit hirundo,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 526>	" Adventusque sui tempora certa tenent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 527>	" Nuncius aurorse merulam comitatur alauda,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 528>	" Nee sua permutant tempora lege nova.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 529>	" Semper idem repetens, veteri nova tempora voce
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 530>	" Ostendit cuculus, nil novitatis habens.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 531>	" Concentu parili vocum concordia ^. discors
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 532>	" Intonat, et silvis organa mille sonant.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 533>	" Certat odor florum cantus superare volucrum ;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 534>	" Organa vox superat, balsama vincit odor.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 535>	" Dulce sonant silvte, redolent thymiamata, campi,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 536>	" Floribus et fructu gignit annona ^ solum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 537>	" ^stuat festive tellus fervore coacta,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 538>	" Solvitur ill cineres quod fuit ante lutum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 539>	" Terra parit pulices, pariuntque cadavera vermes,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 540>	" Aera conturbat improba musca volans.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 541>	" Ardor agit pecudes, pariter conturbat oester,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 542>	" Advolat et musca sordida, dente procax.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 543>	" Per juga, per coUes, per devia quseque locorum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 544>	" ])iruptis stabulis solvitur omne pecus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 545>	" Insidet armento stimulo perdurus oester,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 546>	" Assunt et vespes, immoderata lues.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 547>	" Saltibus et silvis currunt sine lege vagantes
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 548>	" Cum grege pastores, praecipitando graduni.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 549>	" Uritur omne pecus, sudant animalia passim,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 550>	" Spargitur armentum, difFugiuntque greges.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 551>	" Brunettam ^ sequitur pariter fugiendo Bicornis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 552>	" Qugeque tuta minus fortius urget iter,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 553>	" Cui sua Cauda manet muscis Brunetta ^ resistit
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 554>	" Fortiter, impendens pro vice seepe vicem.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 555>	" Ventilat hinc vespes,'* alias dispergit oestres,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 556>	" Dissipat et muscas, seque tuetur ab his.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 557>	" Usee abit, ilia volat,** fugit haec,^ comitantur et " illi,8
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 558>	" Hi stimulant, mordent,^ urget et ilia pedes.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 559>	" Aggreditur tandem miseram nudamque Bicornem
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 560>	" Turbine multiplici turba proterva nimis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 561>	" Quid faceret misera ? quo se lugubris, et aniens ^'^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 562>	" Verteret, in tantis nuda relicta malis ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 563>	" Quod potuit fecit, licuit dum currere, cursu
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 564>	" Certavit crebro'^ prsecipitoque ^^ pede.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 565>	" Prtevenit ala pedem, vincitque volans gradientem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 566>	" Plus pede currentis penna volantis liabet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 567>	" Arma gerunt pacem, qui jiugnaturus inermis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 568>	" Advenit, ex facili succubuisse potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 569>	'' Conveniunt muscse, vespes ^ giomerantur in iinum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 570>	" Torvus oester adest, cuspide, dente nocens.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 571>	" Prsecipito ^ cursu terras dilapsa per oraiies,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 572>	" Donee deficeret, institit ipsa pedes.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 573>	" Nee minus egit earn caudae pudor ille retrorsura,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 574>	" Quam stimuli quibus est obsita tota siraul.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 575>	" Ergo resupina tandem sub colle jugoso.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 576>	" Corruit in terram preecipitata tamen,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 577>	" Cumque foret morti jam jam vicina, resumptis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 578>	" Viribus, ad modicum extulit ilia caput.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 579>	" Aspiciensque prope comites de morte gementes,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 580>	" Brunettamque ^ suam, talia dixit eis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 581>	Plmictus Bicornis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 582>	" Quam gi-avis ista dies, quam sit memoranda* mo" dernis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 583>	" Casibus ex nostris discere^ quisque potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 584>	" Nee mihi mors gravis est, quoniam, si vita superstes
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 585>	" Esset, adhuc gTavior hsec mihi morte foret.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 586>	" Dulce mori miseris, mors est mihi mite levamen,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 587>	" Morte nihil miseris mitius esse potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 588>	" Non est mors oneri, sed plus conducit honori,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 589>	" Cum mors est talis quod cavet® ipsa^ malis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 590>	" Mors invita dabit requiem, quam vita negavit ; *
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 591>	" Nil mihi morte perit, sed relevamen erit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 592>	" Exemplum multis vixi, moriorque futurum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 593>	" Omnibus exemplum, non habitura modum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 594>	Confessio Bicornis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 595>	Discite quam prope sit et quam vicina ruinse
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 596>	" Gloria mundana,^ quse ratione caret.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 597>	Impetus evertit quicquid fortuna ministrat
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 598>	" Prospera, nil stabile cui dedit ille^ statum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 599>	Discite quam nihil est, quicquid peritura voluptas
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 600>	" Possidet, et falso^ preedicat esse suura.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 601>	Nil proprium natura dedit, communia quseque
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 602>	" Instituit fieri, quo meliora forent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 603>	Discite quse nostrse fuerint discrimina caudse,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 604>	" Quodque necis causam contulit ilia mihi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 605>	Plura loqui voluit, sed lingua deficiente
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 606>	" Vix tanturn * potuit dicere, Bruna, vale !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 607>	Pastores igitur, ne fama periret in sevum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 608>	" Signarunt tali grammate busta loci : ^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 609>	Epitaphiuin Bicornis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 610>	Qiice dura stulta fuit, doctos docuisse prohatur,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 611>	" Hcec ijostqaam sapuit,^ vermihus esca datur.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 612>	Reductio Galieni.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 613>	Hsec igitur, Burnelle, tibi quae vidimus^ ipsi^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 614>	" Diximus, exemplis ut docearis ab his.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 615>	' Sufficiat quod habes ; quoniam, si vera fatemur,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 616>	" Stulta petis, salvo semper honore tuo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 617>	' Nee tamen id fieri quovis medicamine posse
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 618>	" Credideris ; nihil est tutius ire domum.^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 619>	" Si qiiot habent medici spaciosi^ climata mundi
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 620>	" Htec tibi jurassent, nil nisi verba forent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 621>	" Non tamen id renuo quin possit ^ crescere multum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 622>	" Hsec tua cauda tibi, sed iiuva nulla dari.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 623>	" Fracta vel elisa medicorum cura reformat,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 624>	" Funditus abscisa sic remanere solent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 625>	" Mortua cum vivis nulla ratione cobterent,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 626>	" Ca3sa nee ^ abscisa cura juvare potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 627>	" Unde satis longa poterit tua crescere cauda,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 628>	" Dummodo cum reliqua foedera carne tenet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 629>	" En tamen'* in curis et sumptibus enumerandis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 630>	" Ut decet et debet, copia larga ^ subest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 631>	" Ardua prregnantem poscunt medicamina bursam,®
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 632>	" Res et opes mag-nas vulnera magna volunt.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 633>	Consilium Galieni ironice.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 634>	" Nonne tibi satis est, unam si creverit vilnam
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 635>	" Longior'^ ex tanto quam fuit ante tibi."
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 636>	Talibus auditis modicum subiisit asellus,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 637>	Sic tamen audirent quod fora tota sonum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 638>	Cui Galienus ait : " Festinans perge Salernum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 639>	" Inde relaturus cura quod ista petit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 640>	" Perge, redique celer, noli tardare pedester,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 641>	" Quatuor his quintum si potes adde pedem.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 642>	" Sumptibus ergo tibi nisi tu defeceris ipse,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 643>	" Non tibi deficiet ^ cura laborque meus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 644>	" Sumptibus insistas, nos artibus experiemur,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 645>	" Si valeat "^ nostrse quod valuere manus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 646>	" Accelerans igitur, usus duplomate,^^ longum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 647>	*' Abbreviabis iter, nam via longa nimis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 648>	" Pluribus es notus necnon dilectus amicis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 649>	" Qui tibi subvenient magnaque ^ dona dabunt.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 650>	" Forsitan ex facili poterunt species reperiri,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 651>	" Nee tamen ex facili credimus ilia legi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 652>	" Vasa sed et tecum portabis idonea multa,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 653>	" In quibus et referes - hie habitura locum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 654>	" Cui'a laborqae simul solet exactissimus esse,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 655>	" Ne male depereant lecta locare^ bene.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 656>	" Cuncta locata bene, vasisque recondita dignis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 657>	" Tractari poterunt tutius* atque geri.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 658>	" Mentis liebes quamvis non sis, in pelle notabis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 659>	" Scribei-e nam nosti qua specie sit opus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 660>	[Receptum quod dedit Galienus Burnello ad caudam prolongandam.']
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 661>	" Hsec sunt quae referes variis signata sigillis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 662>	" Ne pereant objicit cura laborque tuus
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 663>	" Marmoris arvinam, furni septemplicis umbram,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 664>	" Quod peperit mulo mula subacta suo
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 665>	" Anseris et milvi modicum de lacte recenti,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 666>	" De lucis ^ cursu, deque timore lupi ;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 667>	" De canis et leporis septenni foedere drachmam
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 668>	" Oscula quee niso misit alauda suo ;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 669>	*' Pavonis propria ^ libram de voce sonora,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 670>	" Ante tamen cauda quam sit adepta sibi
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 671>	" De non contexta rubra ^ sine flamine ^ mappa,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 672>	" Nam risus asini tu dabis ipse tibi ;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 673>	" Allecis^ vel apum croceo de spermate libram,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 674>	" De ciroli ^^ jecore, sanguine, sive pede ;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 675>	" Natalis Domini modicum de nocte salubri
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 676>	" Quae nimis est longa jure valebit ad hoc.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 677>	" In reditu de monte Jovis, de vertice surarao
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 678>	" Accipies ^ libras quatuor, asse minus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 679>	" Alpibus in mediis sancti de nocte Johannis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 680>	" De nive qufe cecidit tu simul^ inde feras.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 681>	" Serpentisque rubrse necnon de cauda ^ colubrse ; *
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 682>	" Utilis est valde, nee tamen illud eme.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 683>	" Hsec bene collecta, pariterque recentia^ qu?eque,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 684>	" Impones humeris sarcinulisque tuis."
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 685>	[Responsio Burnelli.]
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 686>	Talia dicenti supplex respondit asellus,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 687>	Poplite deflexo, vertice pronus humi
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 688>	" Cuncta libens faciam, celer ibo, celerque revertar,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 689>	" Nam mea res agitur, non aliena mihi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 690>	" Non ego ^ tardus ad hoc, quamvis piger esse solebam,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 691>	" Si dederit Dominus prospera cuncta' mihi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 692>	[Petit Burnellus a Galieno henedictionenti.']
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 693>	" En ego progredior, benedic mihi progredienti,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 694>	" Ut mihi sit tota ^ prospera, vita, via ! "
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 695>	Mox idioma suum vertens Galienus, et orans,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 696>	Subridensque ^ parum, sic benedixit ei.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 697>	Benedictio'^^ Oalieni data Burnello.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 698>	" Omnipotens odia^^ tibi mille det, et tua cauda
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 699>	" Obtineat per^^ se millia dena sibi !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 700>	" Sit tibi potus aqua ! sit raagnus carduus esca
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 701>	" Marmora stramenta, tegmina ros et aqua !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 702>	" Grando, nives, pluvise, tecum comitentur ubique,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 703>	" Protegat et noctu cana pruina, gelu I
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 704>	" Saepius exosus veniat post terga molossus !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 705>	Oscula dando tamen, dixit asellus, Amen !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 706>	Ingeminantis Amen vox est audita per urbem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 707>	Murmuriique ^ sonum percipit omne forum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 708>	Qioaliter Burnellus profedus est [versus Scdernum pro speciebus].^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 709>	Festinans igitur, veniens in limine portae
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 710>	H^esit, et eliso corruit ipse pede.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 711>	" Signa revertendi sunt haec," dixere propinqui
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 712>	Eiserunt alii ; dixit et ipse sibi :
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 713>	" Debile principium melior fortuna sequetur ;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 714>	" Restat iter longum, non remanebit ita.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 715>	" Dura satis didici postquam sum fusus ab alvo,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 716>	" Unde satis possum plurima dura pati.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 717>	" Non est deliciis assueta vel ebrietati
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 718>	" Hfec mea persona, quae mala ferre solet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 719>	" Carduus et lappa constant mihi carior esca,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 720>	" Sufficit ad potura nam pluvialis aqua.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 721>	" In salsamentis non est meditatio mentis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 722>	" In tenui victu corpora nostra vigent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 723>	" Sum piger et tardus,^ sed certe tardior essem
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 724>	" Si mea nonnunquam lauta difeta foret.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 725>	" Sed neque qui debet sumptus impendere multos,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 726>	" Expedit, ut crebro vina Falerna bibat.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 727>	" Quid mihi cum vino ? ^ quo desipiunt sapientes,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 728>	" Multaque contingunt quo mediante^ mala.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 729>	" Hoc humeris non ventre suo gestare pareutes
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 730>	" Consuevere mei ; sit procul ergo merum !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 731>	" Ergo gestabo sed non gustabo Lyseum,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 732>	" Arripiat ne me eotidina febris.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 733>	" Contra naturam vinum si forte bibissem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 734>	" Mox raihi quartanam gigneret aut seabiem.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 735>	" Quatuor ex causis teneor vitare Lyasum,"
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 736>	" Quanivis sensus liebes exacuatur ^ eo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 737>	" Sumptibus ut propriis parcam, ne febre laborem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 738>	" Et ne desipiam degeneremque simul.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 739>	" Qui vitare malum poterit, nee vult, manifestum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 740>	" Plangendus minus est, si male cedaf* ei."
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 741>	Qualiter Burnellus venit Salernum \oranH\
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 742>	Postquam bissenas confecerat ergo dia^tas,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 743>	Ad qujB tendebat, mcenia summa videt.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 744>	Moxque ^ genu flexo, sursura sua bracbia tendens,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 745>	Vota Deo supplex solvit, et orat ita
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 746>	" Omnipotens Dominus" mentis sancti Juliani
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 747>	" Det nobis veniam hospitiumque bonum !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 748>	" Sit procul omne malum, pontes, port?eque ^ gemellfe,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 749>	" Partibus in nostris qufe satis esse solent
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 750>	" Rusticus aut saccus non inveniatur in urbe !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 751>	" Absque molendino sit locus iste, precor !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 752>	" Sint liebetes stiumli, surdi mutique molossi,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 753>	" Sitque procul catuli vox inimica mihi
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 754>	" Hospes ruricola mihi sit, cui semper abundet ^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 755>	" Carduus hirsutus et pluvialis aqua.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 756>	" Sint species viles, sit et emptor rarus in urbe,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 757>	" Quilibet existat venditor seris egens !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 758>	" Sint merces multse, sit multum cara moneta
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 759>	" Sit tempus pluvidum, sitque lutosa via.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 760>	" Prospera sint cuncta, sint cuncta salubria nobi.s,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 761>	" Ut nostrum citius expediatur iter."
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 762>	Talia commemorans, postquam pervenit in urbem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 763>	Se dedit hospitio, membraque fessa toro.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 764>	Surgens mane forum ' species empturus adivit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 765>	Quas non inveniens tristis abire parat.
