<nigel_wireker. specstult. 896>	Anget utrumque malum, misero satis esset in unum ''
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 897>	Anxius ille gemit quem duo damna gi'avant.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 898>	An labor ? an sumptus ? an cauda recisa ? dolori ^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 899>	Debeat esse magis dinumerare nequit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 900>	Nam labor est cassus, sumptus periere, recisam
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 901>	Nemo potest caudam restituisse sibi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 902>	Anxietas animi crescit, stimulata^ dolore,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 903>	Alternantquc - vices hiuc dolor, inde pudor.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 904>	Plus tamen affligit pudor, hinc ^ comitante dolore,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 905>	Quam faceret solus absque pudore dolor.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 906>	Totus in ore canum miser et miserabilis ille
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 907>	Volvitur, et soli vix sibi vita manet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 908>	Nee prius a misero se continuere molossi
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 909>	Donee Fromundus vix cohiberet eos.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 910>	Frater Fromundus, fratrum de more suorum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 911>	Non ferus, immo fera dissimulando diu;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 912>	Ut solet illius gentis genus illud iniquum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 913>	Vix etiam tandem tendere coepit eo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 914>	Non tamen accelerans, ni cum pulsatur ad ollam,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 915>	XJt solet ad mensam ventre docente viam
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 916>	Sed pede spondaico gressu gradiens asinino,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 917>	Ut solet ad laudes nocte venire venit
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 918>	Extendensque manura, dicto, benedicite ! ha ! ha !
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 919>	Dixit, et amovit * corripuitque canes.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 920>	Responsio Burnelli [ad Fromundum.]
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 921>	Cui Burnellus ait ; " Nunquam sis tu ^ benedictus,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 922>	" Sed maledicaris tempus in omne tuum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 923>	" Num Benedictus ita docuit vos, in peregrines
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 924>	" Instigare canes ? Num ^ Benedictus ita ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 925>	" Hie est ordo novus ; h?ec nova regula, frater,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 926>	" Observanda tibi, tradita jure novo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 927>	" Nunquid Cisterci canon fuit iste ^ repertus ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 928>	" Venit et hinc ad nos ordinis iste rigor ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 929>	" Numquid in hoc anno qui convenere sub uno
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 930>	" Istud prseceptum constituere patres ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 931>	" Summi pontificis canibus vexare ministrum ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 932>	" Nescio si vobis regula vestra jubet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 933>	" Nescio si vobis liceat morti dare quenquam,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 934>	" Prsecipue causa non prseeunte necis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 935>	" Pontificis summi medicamina maxima portans
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 936>	" Hue ego perveni, nil meditando mali.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 937>	" Per sata transivi fateor peregrinus, et liospes
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 938>	" Quo tamen erravi callis apertus erat.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 939>	" Semita magna fuit, quam rebar et esse plateam,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 940>	" Tum quia lata nimis, turn quia trita satis.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 941>	" Error inest facto, non prsemeditata voluntas ;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 942>	" Si qua fuit culpa, non nisi parva fuit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 943>	" Culpa levis tanto non est ^ plectenda rigore
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 944>	" Mitior in minimis debuit esse modus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 945>	" Quamvis culpa foret, etiam dignissima plecti,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 946>	" Hoc plectenda modo non fuit illa^ tamen.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 947>	" Criminis ad pondus deberet poena rependi,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 948>	" Major poena suo crimine crimen habet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 949>	" Summi pontificis ego nuncius atque minister
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 950>	" Pacificus veni, devia forte sequens.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 951>	" Pontificis summi timor et reverentia vestrum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 952>	" Debuit ex^ aliqua parte levare malum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 953>	" Quod tamen auxerunt ; non est in partibus istis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 954>	" Qui timeat Dominum pontificemve suum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 955>	" Non mihi, sed Domino, gravis est injuria facta
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 956>	" Nostram papa suam vindicet ipse Deus.*
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 957>	" In dominum papam transgressio facta redundat,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 958>	" Lseditur et tanto curia tota malo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 959>	" Horrendum facinus, tam detestabile factum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 960>	" Tam gravis excussus ^ nunquid inultus erit ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 961>	" In domini papse contemptu tam manifesto
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 962>	" Roma nisi fuerit usa rigore suo,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 963>	" Ut breve sit dedecus, longum sit decus amicis,^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 964>	" Hostibus eveniant dedecus atque decus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 965>	" Noil erit ulterius qurevis metuenda potestas,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 966>	" Sed quod cuique- libet jure licebit ei.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 967>	" In dominum nostrum papam dedecusque redundat,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 968>	" Csetera sustineo vulnera solus esfo.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 969>	" Damnum marcarum plusquam duo millia constat,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 970>	" Sum])tibus exceptis, absque labore vi;e.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 971>	" Quanti sit dedecus at nescio,- noverit ille
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 972>	" Ad quem spectat honor, spectat et istud oiius.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 973>	" Est dedecus magnum, sed summus prnesul utrumque
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 974>	" Puniet ad libitum, criminis ultor erit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 975>	" Curia Romana, quje dignis digna rependit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 976>	" Pro meritis dignis prremia digna dabit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 977>	" Causa gravis, gravior persona, gravissima damna
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 978>	" Esse patet, magnum singula pondus habent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 979>	" In dominum papam specialiter ista redundant,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 980>	" Lnesus et est graviter ; vulnus utrumque patet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 981>	" Quod gravius dicet, citius leviusque remittet;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 982>	" Quod levins, poena sub graviore cadet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 983>	" Lsesus honor lacrimis poterit precibusque piari,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 984>	" Ne nimis ulcisci se videatur in hoc.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 985>	" Damna sed illius nulla ratione remittet
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 986>	" Mitis erit, redimi sed patiatur ea.^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 987>	" Dummodo solvendus ^ fuerit Cistercicus ^ ordo,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 988>	" Nil sibi de toto deperiisse potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 989>	" Aut decimas solvant, et^ braccis lege perenni,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 990>	" Quamvis inviti, posteriora tegent.^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 991>	" Claustra nee exibunt, perdentque novalia passim,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 992>	" Aut tria mercarum millia plena dabunt.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 993>	" Sortem cum poena solvent tria milia plena,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 994>	" Et nisi festinent solvere mille dabunt.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 995>	*•' Sed quid erit de me ? Qusenam vindicta sequetur ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 996>	" Qualiter uleiscar sic laceratus ego?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 997>	" Papa quidem statuet ne quis de fratribus extra
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 998>	" Septa sui claustri quolibet ire queat.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 999>	" Quam si quis fucrit legem trangz'essus, eorum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1000>	" Ha3C tria perpetuo jure sequantur^ eum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1001>	" Nunquam vina bibat,^ nisi cruda legumina gustet,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1002>	" Sitque gravis culpa pcena perennis ei.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1003>	" H?ec de jure poli faciet mihi papa libenter
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1004>	" Sed de jure fori quid genus orane meum ? ''
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1005>	" Istud erit quod ego faciam statuisse per orbem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1006>	" Si fuerit tanto tempore vita comes.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1007>	" Istos conversos, quos perversos magis esse
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1008>	" Constat, ut ex factis nomina certa trahant.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1009>	" Ecclesise portam quisquis conspexerit extra,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1010>	" Mox oculos dextros auferat atque pedes.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1011>	" Et nisi campana collo dependeat una,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1012>	" Mentvila tollatur, quodque cohferet ei.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1013>	" Dentur eis braccse, vinum tollatur in gevum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1014>	" Damnaturque ** caro, piscis, et ova simul.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1015>	" Sufficiant cunctis duo cocta legumina tantuni,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1016>	" Vel potius cruda, sit nisi festa dies.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1017>	" Hsec ego cuncta raeos faciam stabilire parentes,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1018>	" Ne sit in feternum res habitura modum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1019>	" Hsec etiam papa sic confirmabit in sevum,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1020>	" Subscribetque suas curia tota notas."
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1021>	Simulatio fratris Fromundi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1022>	Talibus auditis, timuit Fromundus, et ultra
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1023>	Quam credi poterit obstupefactus ait
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1024>	" Si sciat hsec abbas, nee eum res tanta latebit,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1025>	" Culleus ant certe mors mihi certa manet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1026>	*' Quis furor irapegit canibus vexare ministrum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1027>	" Pontilicis summi ? Non ita rebar ego.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1028>	" Nunc opus est facto, sed et hoc^ nimis accelerate
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1029>	" Nunc opus auxilio consilioque mihi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1030>	" Constat enim quod si vivens discesserit iste,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1031>	" Res nulla poterit conditione tegi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1032>	" Blanditiis opus est multis insistere, donee
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1033>	" Una dies veniat quae sit ad istud opus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1034>	" Tollere de medio decet hunc, ne tota per ipsum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1035>	" Gens pereat, nostra depereantque loca.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1036>	" Sed nimis astute tanturn scelus est faciendum ;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1037>	" Et procul a populo convenit istud agi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1038>	" Nam si fama loquax quicquam cognoverit inde,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1039>	" Pejus erit multo quam fuit ante malum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1040>	" Plus etiam fratres raihi sunt quam fama timori,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1041>	" Nam furor illorum nescit habere modum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1042>	" Fama potest aliquo saltem moderamine flecti, " lUos cum furiunt flectere nemo potest.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1043>	" Fratribus atque foro par est committere quicquam,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1044>	" Prodere ^ quod timeam, vel latuisse velim.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1045>	" Una fori facies, fratrum sunt mille, quid ergo ?
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1046>	" Quod cupis occultum reddere nemo sciat.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1047>	" Menstrua namque fides faciem cum tempore mutat;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1048>	" Ne credas fidei, sit mihi fida tibi.'
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1049>	" Qui se multorum fidei committere curat,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1050>	" Auguror hunc leviter posse carere fide.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1051>	" Res erit arcana, qu?e sunt facienda seorsum
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1052>	" Nemo sciat; satis est ut solus ipse"* sciam.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1053>	" Quid moror ? accedam supplex, veniamque precabor,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1054>	" Reddere promittani perdita quseque prius.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1055>	" Accipiam stultum, socium simulabo fidelem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1056>	" Committet sese credulus ille^ mihi."
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1057>	Dixit, et accessit supplex, veniaque petita,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1058>	Plus quam perdiderat reddere spondet ei.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1059>	Hospitiique mora longos relevare labores
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1060>	Obtulit, et molli membra fovere toro.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1061>	Spondet opes, medicos, generalia festa, salubris
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1062>	Aeris accessum, quicquid et ipse velit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1063>	Nil deerit votis, simul et semel omne quod optat
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1064>	Accidet, accedat ipse videre locum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1065>	Nam prope Lugdunum Rodani conterminus^ undis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1066>	Est situs arboribus consitus ^ ille locus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1067>	Est alter Paradisus ibi, quia quicquid habere
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1068>	Mens humana cupit terra beata parat.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1069>	Ipse loci dominus domui disponet, ut ejus
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1070>	Cederit^ arbitrio, nemo rebellis erit.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1071>	Serviet ad nutum famulus, venietque vocatus,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1072>	Quisque placebit ei, quisque sequetm- eum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1073>	Ipse modum dicet sibi,'* quo servire clientes
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1074>	Hos velit aut illos,^ nemo resistet ei.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1075>	Nee novus hospes erit,^ nee ut advena eras rediturus,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1076>	Sed quasi perpetuus civis in urbe sua.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1077>	Postulat, adjurat, hortatur, et omnia spondet,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1078>	Vimque facit precibus, voce manuque trahens.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1079>	Dissimidatio Burnelli.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1080>	Annuit ille libens, tamen hac sub conditione,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1081>	ToUat ut e medio mors inopina canes ;
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1082>	Comperiensque dolos Fromundi, dissimulare
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1083>	Rem studet, et risu ^ palliat ore levi.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1084>	Dixit et ipse ^ sibi secum duo verba, nee ilia
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1085>	Sic tamen audiret ut suus hospes ea.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1086>	" En aliud minans aliud meditatur asellus,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1087>	" Eventus varios dissona vota tenent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1088>	" Ssepe solet vitio virtus velocior^ esse.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1089>	" Pra3venit et morbuni cuia diseita gravem.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1090>	" Fraude cadunt fraudes, fulluntur et artibus artes,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1091>	" Obruiturque dolus pr?evenieiite dolo."
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1092>	Nee mora, Fromundus, correptis fuste - molossis,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1093>	Disponit socium fallere fraude suum."^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1094>	[Quomodo Burnellus vindicat se de fraude Fromundi.]
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1095>	Cumque super ripam Rodani * graderetur asellus,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1096>	Et prope Fromundus subsequeretur eum,
