<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1206>	" Est melius quod non redeam mutilatus in urbem,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1207>	" Donee prisca tegam criraina sorte nova.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 1208>	" Corpus adhuc sanum superest, patiensque laborum,
