<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2319>	" Sed comedente male nee cohibente gulam.'^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2320>	" Causa datur vino, debetur culpa ^ bibenti,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2321>	" Cum caput, aut membra cwitera^" mane dolent.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2322>	" Ne pareat ^^ psalmus vel lectio ta;dia longa,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2323>	" In psallendo tenent inque legendo modum.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2324>	" Nee nituntur ad hoc ut vocilnis immoderatis
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2325>	" Ardua pnevaleant rumpere tecta domus.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2326>	" Candida sed pura ' subtili stamine- toxta,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2327>	" Mundi« uiunda placet iinca vestis eis.^
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2328>	" Vestis lionesta quidcm, quio nee cum came rebelli
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2329>	" Ut ' cute bella gerat ^ asperitato sui.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2330>	" Exteriora tamen claudentur themate** nigro,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2331>	" Ut color alterius aptior esse queat.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2332>	" Lumina ne Iredat, albo'^ nigredo repugnat,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2333>	" Inque timore nigro gaudia candor liabet.
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2334>	" Sic arcus coeli geniino splendore ^ refulget,
<nigel_wireker. specstult. 2335>	" Sic pilus est pardo candidus atqi\e niger.
